# olr-pinned-exe.bin

Place a copy of the pinned OpenLogReplicator binary here (sha256 must equal `pin_bin` in `bin/dg_r3_recovery_olr.sh`).

Generate once on DG1:

```bash
cp /opt/olr-rac/src/rac9-wsguard-r1/cmake-build-release/OpenLogReplicator tests/fixtures/olr-pinned-exe.bin
sha256sum -c <<< '4d93d70a98cd915c6a665929498e867bd2bec1b01be185620d4d15237cfbb9af  tests/fixtures/olr-pinned-exe.bin'
```

Or set `OLR_PINNED_EXE_SOURCE` when running `bin/run_local_verify.sh`.
